name pitex
category Package
revision 24731
shortdesc Documentation macros
relocated 1
longdesc The bundle provides macros that the author uses when writing
longdesc documentation (for example, that of the texapi and yax
longdesc packages). The tools could be used by anyone, but there is no
longdesc documentation, and the macros are subject to change without
longdesc notice.
